Scope note

This licence covers the original code and documentation in this repository.

It does not cover:

- `data/source/students.csv` and `data/source/payments.csv`, which are the
  exercise data supplied by the Nathaniel School of Music for this assignment.
  They are included so the project can be run and reviewed, not as a dataset
  to redistribute.
- The three melodies (Twinkle Twinkle Little Star, Ode to Joy, Happy Birthday),
  which are traditional and in the public domain.
- The name "Dhun" and any material belonging to the Nathaniel School of Music.
  This is an independent clone built for a hiring exercise, not an official
  product.
